<card id="c" title="Gusinje Bus Stop: Where the Bus to Podgorica and Plav Actually Stops">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p><b>Gusinje Bus Stop: Where the Bus to Podgorica and Plav Actually Stops</b><br/><small>28.08.2026</small></p>
<p align="center"><img src="/wap/img/0e8e8a95ab91a74a7dd074e6c007db670a2868ec.wbmp" alt="I love Gusinje sign in the centre of Gusinje, Montenegro, with the Prokletije mountains behind"/></p>
<p>Hi. You are probably looking for the same thing I was: where the bus actually stops in Gusinje.</p>
<p>I walked down from Vusanje to Gusinje and then spent a while trying to find the bus. There is no station, no shelter, no sign, no timetable on a pole. Every guide online says &quot;take the bus from Gusinje&quot; and stops there. So here is the exact spot where I found it.</p>
<p><b>The bus stop</b></p>
<p>No shelter, no sign, just a wide bit of the main road through Gusinje. The route starts here, so there is nothing to flag down.</p>
